<title>UK: BADMINTON-WORLD CHAMPIONSHIPS MEN'S RESULTS.</title>
<headline>BADMINTON-WORLD CHAMPIONSHIPS MEN'S RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>GLASGOW 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of men's singles matches at the world individual badminton championships on Wednesday (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Second round:</p>
<p>1-Dong Jiong (China) beat Pavel Uvarov (Russia) 15-11 15-5</p>
<p>10-Thomas Stuer-Lauridsen (Sweden) beat Jeroen van Dijk (Netherlands) 18-16 15-6</p>
<p>6-Ong Ewe Hock (Malaysia) beat Darren Hall (England)  18-13 15-6</p>
<p>12-Heryanto Arbi (indonesia) beat Mike Beres (Canada) 15-4 15-11</p>
<p>4-Indra Wijaya (Indonesia) beat Mark Constable (England) 15-3 15-11</p>
<p>15-Mark Rasmussen (Denmark) beat Lin Liwen (China) 15-7 15-1</p>
<p>8-Park Sung-woo (South Korea) beat Dicky Palyama (Netherlands) 15-5 15-9</p>
<p>13-Allan Budi Kusama (Indonesia) beat Henrik Bengtsson (Sweden) 15-9 15-5</p>
</text>
